#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To download the needed files using <xref linkend='wget'/>, use the following"
" commands:"
msgstr ""
"Para baixar os arquivos necessários usando o <xref linkend='wget'/>, use os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:247
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir app &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd app &amp;&amp;\n"
"grep -v '^#' ../app-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}' | wget -i- -c \\\n"
"    -B &xorg-download-http;/app/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"md5sum -c ../app-&xorg-version;.md5</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir app &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd app &amp;&amp;\n"
"grep -v '^#' ../app-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}' | wget -i- -c \\\n"
"    -B &xorg-download-http;/app/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"md5sum -c ../app-&xorg-version;.md5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:256
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Xorg Applications"
msgstr "Instalação dos Aplicativos do Xorg"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:261
#, xml-text
msgid "First, start a subshell that will exit on error:"
msgstr "Primeiro, inicie um sub shell que sairá em caso de erro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:264
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:267
#, xml-text
msgid "Install all of the packages by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale todos os pacotes executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:270
#, no-wrap, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "<userinput>for package in $(grep -v '^#' ../app-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}')\n"
#| "do\n"
#| "  packagedir=${package%.tar.?z*}\n"
#| "  tar -xf $package\n"
#| "  pushd $packagedir\n"
#| "     case $packagedir in\n"
#| "       luit-[0-9]* )\n"
#| "         sed -i -e \"/D_XOPEN/s/5/6/\" configure\n"
#| "       ;;\n"
#| "     esac\n"
#| "\n"
#| "     ./configure $XORG_CONFIG\n"
#| "     make\n"
#| "     as_root make install\n"
#| "  popd\n"
#| "  rm -rf $packagedir\n"
#| "done</userinput>"
msgid ""
"<userinput>for package in $(grep -v '^#' ../app-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}')\n"
"do\n"
"  packagedir=${package%.tar.?z*}\n"
"  tar -xf $package\n"
"  pushd $packagedir\n"
"     ./configure $XORG_CONFIG\n"
"     make\n"
"     as_root make install\n"
"  popd\n"
"  rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for package in $(grep -v '^#' ../app-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}')\n"
"do\n"
"  packagedir=${package%.tar.?z*}\n"
"  tar -xf $package\n"
"  pushd $packagedir\n"
"     ./configure $XORG_CONFIG\n"
"     make\n"
"     as_root make install\n"
"  popd\n"
"  rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid "Finally, exit the shell that was started earlier:"
msgstr "Finalmente, saia do &quot;shell&quot; que foi iniciado anteriormente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:286
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>exit</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>exit</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Unless you installed the optional dependencies, remove an undocumented "
"script which is reported to be broken (<command>xkeystone</command> provided"
" by the <application>xrandr</application> package)."
msgstr ""
"A menos que você tenha instalado as dependências opcionais, remova um "
"conjunto de comandos sequenciais não documentado que é informado que está "
"quebrado (&quot;<command>xkeystone</command>&quot; fornecido pelo pacote "
"&quot;<application>xrandr</application>&quot;)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7app.xml:294
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>as_root rm -f $XORG_PREFIX/bin/xkeystone</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>as_root rm -f $XORG_PREFIX/bin/xkeystone</userinput>"

